&lt;h2 id="các-vấn-đề-môi-trường-toàn-cầu">Các vấn đề môi trường toàn cầu&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>&lt;code>Hãy tương tác với các biểu đồ dưới đây để hiểu rõ hơn các vấn đề môi trường toàn cầu qua dữ liệu.&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="dân-số-tăng-trưởng">Dân số tăng trưởng&lt;/h3>
&lt;iframe src="https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/population-regions-with-projections?time=1400..latest&amp;tab=chart" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: 600px; border: 0px none;" allow="web-share; clipboard-write">&lt;/iframe>
&lt;h3 id="trái-đất-của-chúng-ta-có-thể-phục-vụ-bao-nhiêu-người">Trái đất của chúng ta có thể phục vụ bao nhiêu người?&lt;/h3>
&lt;div class="hb-columns hb-columns-2">
&lt;div class="hb-column">
&lt;strong>Biocapacity&lt;/strong>
&lt;figure id="figure-nguồn-global-footprint-networkhttpswwwfootprintnetworkorgwhat-biocapacity-measures">
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100" >&lt;img src="https://www.footprintnetwork.org/content/uploads/2025/07/Biocapacity-2025.jpg" alt="Nguồn: [Global Footprint Network](https://www.footprintnetwork.org/what-biocapacity-measures/)" loading="lazy" data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;figcaption>
Nguồn: &lt;a href="https://www.footprintnetwork.org/what-biocapacity-measures/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Global Footprint Network&lt;/a>
&lt;/figcaption>&lt;/figure>
On the supply side, Biocapacity stands for the regenerative capacity of our planet’s ecosystems.
&lt;/div>
&lt;div class="hb-column">
&lt;strong>Ecological footprint&lt;/strong>
&lt;figure id="figure-nguồn-global-footprint-networkhttpswwwfootprintnetworkorgwhat-ecological-footprints-measure">
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100" >&lt;img src="https://www.footprintnetwork.org/content/uploads/2025/07/Ecological-Footprint-2025.jpg" alt="Nguồn: [Global Footprint Network](https://www.footprintnetwork.org/what-ecological-footprints-measure/)" loading="lazy" data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;figcaption>
Nguồn: &lt;a href="https://www.footprintnetwork.org/what-ecological-footprints-measure/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Global Footprint Network&lt;/a>
&lt;/figcaption>&lt;/figure>
On the demand side, The Ecological Footprint is a metric of human demand on ecosystems
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>
